WEBVTT

01:54.031 --> 01:56.200
There, the red truck.

02:17.805 --> 02:18.931
Morning, sir.

02:21.058 --> 02:23.473
Did you call the boys?

02:23.477 --> 02:24.687
They're coming.

02:26.355 --> 02:27.565
It's over there.

02:29.400 --> 02:32.403
Right in the middle of the road.

02:39.326 --> 02:40.995
You all went hunting?

02:41.495 --> 02:43.034
-Yes, sir.
-Morning.

02:43.038 --> 02:44.498
-Morning, Chief.
-Chief.

02:47.459 --> 02:48.752
Nice gun.

02:50.212 --> 02:51.167
Me?

02:51.171 --> 02:53.382
Yeah, you. Bring it here.

03:02.224 --> 03:03.763
A carbine.

03:03.767 --> 03:05.849
Where did you get this?

03:05.853 --> 03:08.731
-It's registered.
-Like hell it is.

03:09.690 --> 03:11.271
You can't register
guns like this.

03:11.275 --> 03:12.606
It's registered.

03:12.610 --> 03:14.566
He's right, it's registered.

03:14.570 --> 03:17.319
Got his permit and all.
I've seen it.

03:17.323 --> 03:19.491
Little shits.

03:22.119 --> 03:24.326
Come see me later.
With the gun.

03:24.330 --> 03:25.456
Yes, sir.

03:30.377 --> 03:32.375
Who found that?

03:32.379 --> 03:34.214
We did.

04:03.410 --> 04:06.038
Holy shit.

04:08.832 --> 04:10.584
What is this?

04:21.929 --> 04:23.885
What the hell happened?

04:23.889 --> 04:25.557
That's why I reported it.

04:26.225 --> 04:28.310
It wasn't here earlier.

04:29.311 --> 04:32.185
We found it on our way back.
About an hour ago.

04:32.189 --> 04:33.899
Hold these.

04:36.235 --> 04:39.405
Jesus...

04:40.072 --> 04:43.367
What could've done this?

04:43.826 --> 04:47.534
It ripped him up
but didn't eat a thing.

04:47.538 --> 04:52.334
I figure something big tried
but just couldn't.

04:56.046 --> 04:58.674
I've seen it all now.

05:06.557 --> 05:07.641
This...

05:11.020 --> 05:13.814
This could've been a bear.

05:14.356 --> 05:15.816
It wasn't a bear.

05:16.400 --> 05:17.605
Why not?

05:17.609 --> 05:20.358
Those marks.
Bear claws aren't that big.

05:20.362 --> 05:22.281
Maybe yay big?

05:24.950 --> 05:26.785
I can see that.

05:28.704 --> 05:30.247
It was probably a tiger.

05:35.377 --> 05:39.006
They saw tracks in the
mountains a few days ago.

05:43.969 --> 05:45.467
Who is they?

05:45.471 --> 05:49.933
-Mr. Hae-sul.
-Don't give me that bullshit.

05:50.601 --> 05:52.891
How would a tiger get out here?

05:52.895 --> 05:55.105
We're surrounded by minefields.

05:56.440 --> 05:57.937
It's just what Mr. Hae-sul said.

05:57.941 --> 05:59.693
But use your damn head.

06:00.444 --> 06:02.780
A fucking tiger?

06:03.530 --> 06:05.699
But that's really what he said.

06:07.201 --> 06:10.829
If Mr. Hae-sul said so, it's true.

06:11.330 --> 06:13.953
This is part of
the tiger's territory.

06:13.957 --> 06:15.497
It starts from Siberia.

06:15.501 --> 06:18.587
Comes down past North Korea
once every few years.

06:19.838 --> 06:21.840
-Going around the mines?
-Yep.

06:22.841 --> 06:24.218
And the barbed-wire fence?

06:24.843 --> 06:27.133
I reckon there are dog holes.

06:27.137 --> 06:28.889
Dogholes, my ass.

06:32.559 --> 06:34.978
Is he serious?

06:35.687 --> 06:39.608
If Mr. Hae-sul said so, it's true.

06:40.567 --> 06:42.649
Why haven't I heard this before?

06:42.653 --> 06:44.571
Everyone else knows.

06:46.073 --> 06:48.321
That's right.

06:48.325 --> 06:49.952
-Yep.
-Everyone knows.

06:52.830 --> 06:54.998
Jeez...

07:00.504 --> 07:01.839
-Sung-ki.
-Yeah.

07:03.340 --> 07:05.968
What do we do if it really
is a tiger?

07:06.552 --> 07:10.764
If it's started killing,
that's real dangerous.

07:11.140 --> 07:13.142
We gotta catch it right away.

07:14.852 --> 07:17.521
If it went into town,
we're in deep shit.

07:18.438 --> 07:21.400
That's why I called in the boys.

07:21.900 --> 07:23.443
They're sharp.

07:25.529 --> 07:27.026
Them too?

07:27.030 --> 07:28.699
Yep. Even sharper.

07:29.575 --> 07:31.573
Good work, cousin.

07:31.577 --> 07:34.117
Split in two and poke around.

07:34.121 --> 07:35.827
Let's start by figuring out
where it went.

07:35.831 --> 07:36.786
Yeah.

07:36.790 --> 07:40.752
And get this thing off the road.
It's nasty.

07:49.553 --> 07:50.721
I'm off.

07:51.972 --> 07:54.516
See you, sir.

08:07.613 --> 08:11.571
Warn civilians to stay inside.

08:11.575 --> 08:15.370
Use our emergency network
to call in the reservists.

08:15.746 --> 08:18.582
Put them on active patrol
right away.

08:19.291 --> 08:21.376
<i>There's only eight of them.</i>

08:22.586 --> 08:23.962
Why only eight?

08:24.755 --> 08:26.544
<i>There's only ever been eight.</i>

08:26.548 --> 08:28.796
REPORT SPIES: CALL 113
Well, shit.

08:28.800 --> 08:29.885
Then...

08:30.469 --> 08:33.889
call around to the
shotgun owners for backup.

08:34.264 --> 08:35.807
Get Jae-duk to help you.

08:36.516 --> 08:37.768
<i>Yes, Chief.</i>

08:39.228 --> 08:40.854
<i>Is it really a tiger?</i>

08:41.271 --> 08:43.269
Yeah, that's what they're saying.

08:43.273 --> 08:46.439
It comes around
once every few years, right?

08:46.443 --> 08:48.070
<i>What are you talking about?</i>

08:48.612 --> 08:51.490
They said everyone knows that.

08:52.032 --> 08:54.451
<i>That's news to me.</i>

08:55.494 --> 08:57.537
-Those bastards.
<i>-Who said that?</i>

08:58.497 --> 09:00.249
Forget it. I'll be back soon.

09:00.582 --> 09:01.996
<i>Yes, Chief.</i>

09:02.000 --> 09:04.253
Goddamn jerkoffs...

09:05.712 --> 09:07.252
Dispatch. Dispatch.

09:07.256 --> 09:09.466
This is 176, Unit 1.

09:10.300 --> 09:11.885
<i>Go ahead.</i>

09:12.302 --> 09:16.807
Hello, this is Bum-seok
from Hope Harbor.

09:17.391 --> 09:21.057
<i>That you, Bum-seok?
What a surprise.</i>

09:21.061 --> 09:24.314
We got a bit of a situation here.

09:24.731 --> 09:26.024
Do you have a moment?

09:26.608 --> 09:28.193
<i>What is it?</i>

09:31.238 --> 09:35.158
WARNING: WILD ANIMALS /
MINES IN AREA / REPORT SPIES

09:41.957 --> 09:44.376
Did Mr. Hae-sul really say that?

09:45.002 --> 09:46.211
Nah.

09:46.545 --> 09:49.006
-Never even seen him.
-Crazy fuck.

09:49.965 --> 09:53.510
Better lay low or
he'll fuck you up.

09:53.844 --> 09:55.341
Don't matter.

09:55.345 --> 09:57.222
I'm back on the boat tomorrow.

10:02.060 --> 10:03.975
Hold up. Pull over.

10:03.979 --> 10:05.143
See something?

10:05.147 --> 10:07.353
Found it. Isn't that it?

10:07.357 --> 10:08.896
Where, dumb-ass?

10:08.900 --> 10:10.861
That fence right there.

10:41.433 --> 10:42.809
It's that bull's hair.

10:52.402 --> 10:54.571
Aw hell.

10:55.906 --> 10:58.450
Get your gear.

11:01.244 --> 11:02.871
<i>Oh my Lord.</i>

11:03.622 --> 11:05.912
<i>But there's no one here.</i>

11:05.916 --> 11:09.753
<i>They're all away
putting out the mountain fires.</i>

11:10.087 --> 11:13.256
Spare us some county staffers
at least.

11:13.799 --> 11:17.006
You know it's mostly
elderly folk here.

11:17.010 --> 11:19.638
<i>The staffers are gone too.</i>

11:20.180 --> 11:23.433
<i>But I get what you mean.
I'll see what I can do.</i>

11:24.434 --> 11:25.640
Thank you.

11:25.644 --> 11:27.312
By the way...

11:27.687 --> 11:29.189
Have you...

11:29.773 --> 11:31.733
seen a tiger?

11:32.317 --> 11:35.487
<i>What kind of a nonsense
question is that?</i>

11:36.696 --> 11:38.115
<i>You been drinking?</i>

11:38.949 --> 11:41.743
HOPE HARBOR

12:48.393 --> 12:49.603
Shit.

12:50.312 --> 12:52.147
It fucking stinks.

12:52.564 --> 12:55.525
It must've ate this one.
Tore the legs right off.

12:59.029 --> 13:02.657
Fuck me. This is serious shit.

13:05.994 --> 13:09.160
Whatever it is, it did this too.

13:09.164 --> 13:10.665
Yeah.

13:11.082 --> 13:14.836
Doesn't it smell more like fish
than rotting meat?

13:17.380 --> 13:19.712
You're right. It's fish.

13:19.716 --> 13:21.051
Gentlemen.

13:23.762 --> 13:25.472
Quit jabbering and get over here.

13:27.057 --> 13:28.642
Hurry up!

13:36.316 --> 13:37.108
What?

13:40.570 --> 13:42.364
What is it?

14:01.591 --> 14:05.216
ONE HEART

14:05.220 --> 14:07.389
Shit.

14:08.390 --> 14:10.016
This just went to hell.

14:11.226 --> 14:13.683
Mr. Ko's cattle shed?

14:13.687 --> 14:16.398
<i>Don't know about that.</i>

14:16.773 --> 14:19.818
<i>But the right arm tattoo
said One Heart.</i>

14:20.485 --> 14:23.818
<i>That's him. Did you find the body?</i>

14:23.822 --> 14:26.571
No. We couldn't find anything.

14:26.575 --> 14:29.619
<i>Holy shit. Jesus.</i>

14:30.370 --> 14:32.664
<i>Was he eaten then?</i>

14:33.164 --> 14:34.620
I think so.

14:34.624 --> 14:37.206
This is fucking insane.

14:37.210 --> 14:39.667
Sung-ki, you sure about the tiger?

14:39.671 --> 14:41.711
<i>I'm not sure anymore.</i>

14:41.715 --> 14:44.342
<i>You'll see when you get here,</i>

14:44.718 --> 14:46.966
<i>but that thing out there
is no joke.</i>

14:46.970 --> 14:49.885
-Okay well...
<i>-Yeah.</i>

14:49.889 --> 14:51.596
Hurry back to town.

14:51.600 --> 14:52.680
<i>What?</i>

14:52.684 --> 14:54.765
We're shorthanded.

14:54.769 --> 14:59.478
<i>I'll send over the boys
in the blue truck</i>

14:59.482 --> 15:02.402
<i>while we look around up north.</i>

15:02.902 --> 15:04.609
<i>We can't let this thing run loose.</i>

15:04.613 --> 15:05.985
What the hell?

15:05.989 --> 15:07.616
<i>What is it?</i>

15:08.491 --> 15:09.868
<i>-Chief?
-Hello?</i>

15:10.452 --> 15:13.743
-I'll call you guys back.
<i>-What?</i>

15:13.747 --> 15:18.001
HOPE REAL ESTATE

15:24.924 --> 15:26.885
What in hell.

15:36.311 --> 15:37.437
Shit.

16:13.890 --> 16:15.183
Fuck!

16:25.985 --> 16:29.322
Ma'am. Ma'am!

16:51.970 --> 16:54.760
Officer Yim! Officer Yim!

16:54.764 --> 16:56.470
<i>Yes, Chief.</i>

16:56.474 --> 16:58.723
Come to Hope Real Estate now.

16:58.727 --> 17:00.599
I think it was here.

17:00.603 --> 17:02.230
Call dispatch for backup.

17:02.647 --> 17:05.438
<i>Actually, I've been getting calls.</i>

17:05.442 --> 17:06.981
What? From where?

17:06.985 --> 17:11.110
<i>Two reports near Town Hall.
One near the bridge.</i>

17:11.114 --> 17:14.993
<i>Mr. Hosik is injured and
KS Chicken also called in.</i>

17:15.452 --> 17:17.287
Did you just hear that?

17:17.871 --> 17:18.826
<i>Hear what?</i>

17:18.830 --> 17:20.035
A gun shot.

17:20.039 --> 17:21.082
<i>What?</i>

17:22.459 --> 17:24.377
Damn it, that's gunfire.

17:25.128 --> 17:27.130
<i>Chief! Chief!</i>

17:27.464 --> 17:28.673
<i>Are you alright?</i>

18:42.705 --> 18:44.332
Tae-seok!

18:45.500 --> 18:46.334
Tae-seok!

18:47.210 --> 18:48.211
Tae-seok!

18:49.796 --> 18:50.922
You son of a bitch!

18:57.720 --> 18:58.805
Shit.

19:52.942 --> 19:54.027
My God...

20:18.468 --> 20:24.349
PROTECT THE NATION
FROM INFILTRATION

20:58.216 --> 20:59.258
What the...

21:35.420 --> 21:37.338
What a mess.

21:39.340 --> 21:41.009
We can go up this way.

21:42.427 --> 21:43.674
Wan-seob.

21:43.678 --> 21:44.762
You're tracking up front.

21:45.179 --> 21:46.343
Chung-san.

21:46.347 --> 21:48.053
Bring the grub.

21:48.057 --> 21:50.764
Hustle. We're losing light.

21:50.768 --> 21:52.558
-You got the ammo bag?
-Yeah.

21:52.562 --> 21:54.313
-Don't forget the rope.
-Got it.

21:55.064 --> 21:57.108
Stay on edge, alright?

21:57.692 --> 22:01.154
Perfect place to slip up
and get snuffed.

22:05.950 --> 22:08.161
Don't spread out like before.

22:09.620 --> 22:10.830
We stick together.

23:21.109 --> 23:22.985
That fucker.

23:59.981 --> 24:01.190
Hey asshole!

24:02.400 --> 24:03.776
Don't shoot.

24:04.986 --> 24:07.905
Don't fucking shoot at me.

24:08.698 --> 24:10.112
I said don't shoot!

24:10.116 --> 24:12.034
What are you doing there?

24:12.618 --> 24:13.699
Are you okay?

24:13.703 --> 24:15.826
No, I'm not fucking okay.

24:15.830 --> 24:17.415
Come here.

24:18.291 --> 24:19.458
Come here, now.

24:20.668 --> 24:22.253
Get your ass over here.

24:23.379 --> 24:24.380
Faster.

24:25.631 --> 24:27.091
Run!

24:27.633 --> 24:29.927
I said run. Faster!

24:30.303 --> 24:31.345
Hurry up.

24:31.721 --> 24:34.765
Taking your damn time.

24:37.143 --> 24:38.811
You asshole!

24:39.812 --> 24:43.024
Why would you shoot at me?
You wanna die?

24:44.317 --> 24:46.607
I'm sorry. You scared me.

24:46.611 --> 24:48.942
So you just shoot at a person?

24:48.946 --> 24:49.989
Like I'm a wild boar?

24:50.573 --> 24:52.074
I'm sorry, really.

24:53.492 --> 24:54.660
Bastard.

25:03.294 --> 25:04.545
You have arrows.

25:05.421 --> 25:07.048
Little maggot.

25:07.965 --> 25:09.842
It went this way earlier.

25:13.804 --> 25:15.014
Not that way?

25:15.723 --> 25:17.892
No, this way. Look.

25:25.733 --> 25:27.064
Did you get a look at it?

25:27.068 --> 25:28.319
You bet I did.

25:30.738 --> 25:31.656
What is it?

25:32.823 --> 25:36.827
A freaking monster.
A freaking huge monster.

25:38.287 --> 25:40.957
Can you be more specific?

25:42.291 --> 25:43.417
It's filthy.

25:43.876 --> 25:47.964
Looks like a mush of
peas and beans.

25:49.674 --> 25:52.301
It slouches. Like this.

25:52.718 --> 25:54.091
And?

25:54.095 --> 25:56.555
It's this tall.

25:57.098 --> 25:59.263
Your little gun won't kill it.

25:59.267 --> 26:00.726
Is it like a dinosaur?

26:01.727 --> 26:03.479
I don't know about that.

26:04.855 --> 26:06.315
But it has long arms.

26:06.649 --> 26:08.901
Arms. Not legs?

26:09.694 --> 26:11.946
Arm or leg, who cares.

26:12.405 --> 26:15.157
That's not the point!

26:16.409 --> 26:18.740
So you're saying it went that way?

26:18.744 --> 26:19.825
Yeah.

26:19.829 --> 26:20.955
Alrighty.

26:24.834 --> 26:26.210
Are you staying here?

26:26.544 --> 26:27.624
Why?

26:27.628 --> 26:29.171
Just curious.

26:30.006 --> 26:31.253
Want me to come?

26:31.257 --> 26:32.883
No, I was just asking.

26:36.887 --> 26:38.097
Follow me.

26:55.031 --> 26:57.116
Over there.

27:00.536 --> 27:03.122
-Hurry.
-That way.

27:26.479 --> 27:29.398
GUMBOK BUTCHERY and GRILL

27:47.792 --> 27:48.997
It's in there.

27:49.001 --> 27:50.211
I heard it too.

27:53.089 --> 27:55.257
-Follow me.
-Hey!

27:56.133 --> 27:56.926
Hey!

28:02.681 --> 28:04.683
That stupid numbskull.

28:23.577 --> 28:25.033
Shit.

28:25.037 --> 28:26.831
That motherfucker.

28:27.998 --> 28:28.833
What's wrong?

28:30.793 --> 28:31.877
They're all dead.

28:33.170 --> 28:34.171
How many?

28:35.089 --> 28:37.049
Maybe a dozen.

28:38.426 --> 28:39.718
Holy shit.

29:01.866 --> 29:03.492
You just gonna stand there?

29:04.535 --> 29:05.953
No, I'm going in.

29:06.495 --> 29:07.788
Does your stomach hurt?

29:10.374 --> 29:11.997
A little bit.

29:12.001 --> 29:13.961
For God's sake.

29:14.295 --> 29:15.880
Take care of it then.

29:16.213 --> 29:20.964
Never mind.
I think I'm okay now.

29:20.968 --> 29:21.802
You sure?

29:22.261 --> 29:23.053
Yeah.

29:24.180 --> 29:25.514
Alright.

29:26.307 --> 29:29.639
Then, we go on three.

29:29.643 --> 29:30.811
Okay.

29:33.314 --> 29:34.148
One...

29:35.524 --> 29:36.484
Two...

29:37.193 --> 29:37.985
Three.

29:40.112 --> 29:41.526
Son of a bitch, I knew it.

29:41.530 --> 29:44.529
No, I'm going.
I'm going in right now.

29:44.533 --> 29:45.659
Okay. Then go.

29:46.118 --> 29:47.365
I will!

29:47.369 --> 29:49.830
Go on, damn it!
Stop pissing me off.

30:09.558 --> 30:10.893
Dear God.

31:04.530 --> 31:05.656
Chief!

31:29.638 --> 31:30.514
Kyung-seok.

31:31.890 --> 31:36.437
Fucking bastards...

31:39.940 --> 31:42.610
I'm fucked.

31:46.822 --> 31:48.198
Sweetie...

31:49.325 --> 31:50.951
I'll call you back.

31:56.457 --> 31:58.959
I thought I was on a roll.

32:07.843 --> 32:10.304
Feels breezy...

32:11.138 --> 32:12.973
Bum-seok...

32:13.766 --> 32:15.726
Damn you both.

32:20.648 --> 32:21.690
Kyung-seok!

32:23.317 --> 32:25.152
Kyung-seok.

32:26.612 --> 32:28.405
He's alive!

32:28.947 --> 32:30.532
He's alive. He's alive.

32:31.158 --> 32:33.740
What do we do?

32:33.744 --> 32:35.909
What are you doing?
Get me something.

32:35.913 --> 32:38.040
We have to stop the bleeding.

32:38.499 --> 32:40.918
It's okay, man. Breathe.

32:42.961 --> 32:44.751
Why was this idiot standing there?

32:44.755 --> 32:47.087
Kyung-seok, breathe.

32:47.091 --> 32:48.672
Breathe. Keep still.

32:48.676 --> 32:53.180
That's enough.
Keep applying pressure.

32:54.098 --> 32:56.475
-What should we do?
-What do you mean, what?

33:03.107 --> 33:04.775
Goddamn it.

33:06.360 --> 33:07.273
No answer?

33:07.277 --> 33:09.738
No. Try again in a bit.

33:10.489 --> 33:12.237
-Try where?
-What?

33:12.241 --> 33:13.534
Who do I call?

33:14.368 --> 33:16.495
Who do you think? The police.

33:16.912 --> 33:19.623
-Call the police?
-Yes.

33:19.998 --> 33:23.001
-What should I tell them?
-Tell the truth.

33:23.836 --> 33:25.713
That you shot him?

33:27.840 --> 33:28.841
What...

33:29.675 --> 33:32.094
My God...

33:33.095 --> 33:35.135
You shot him too.

33:35.139 --> 33:37.053
Only because you told me to.

33:37.057 --> 33:39.268
You gotta be kidding!

33:39.601 --> 33:41.516
When did I tell you to
shoot anyone?

33:41.520 --> 33:42.730
Wow, you...

33:43.981 --> 33:45.107
Son of a bitch.

33:47.401 --> 33:49.399
Unbelievable.

33:49.403 --> 33:51.238
Fine. Just get him to the hospital.

33:52.114 --> 33:53.528
Then I'm not gonna report it.

33:53.532 --> 33:55.321
Do whatever you want.

33:55.325 --> 33:56.322
You assholes...

33:56.326 --> 33:59.538
Now, turn around.

34:00.622 --> 34:02.328
-I'm supposed to carry him?
-Yeah.

34:02.332 --> 34:03.751
Why should I?

34:04.209 --> 34:06.503
