55:11.267 --> 55:12.226
Asshole.

55:13.227 --> 55:14.645
Son of a bitch!

55:22.945 --> 55:24.822
Fucking unbelievable.

55:36.333 --> 55:37.501
You okay?

55:38.169 --> 55:39.420
