01:03:11.205 --> 01:03:13.248
It probably fucking ate them.

01:04:01.547 --> 01:04:03.423
How come it left the horses?

01:04:05.467 --> 01:04:06.843
Who knows.

01:04:07.678 --> 01:04:10.264
Maybe it don't eat horses.

01:04:26.405 --> 01:04:28.611
