01:06:09.216 --> 01:06:12.803
Are you Bum-jong's little girl?

01:06:13.387 --> 01:06:17.766
Gwang-soon, actually.
She ran the mill by the bridge.

01:06:18.684 --> 01:06:21.978
That's right. Gwang-soon's girl.

01:06:22.938 --> 01:06:24.394
And your name?

01:06:24.398 --> 01:06:26.316
Sung-ae. Yim Sung-ae.

01:06:26.733 --> 01:06:29.945
Right. Sung-ae.

01:06:32.906 --> 01:06:34.570
Sung-ae.

01:06:34.574 --> 01:06:35.575
Yes.

01:06:36.201 --> 01:06:37.911
That thing earlier.

01:06:38.954 --> 01:06:40.789
That's what I was talking about.

01:06:41.248 --> 01:06:42.620
What is?

01:06:42.624 --> 01:06:45.039
I told you some days back.

01:06:45.043 --> 01:06:48.880
About the hellish sight
I seen in the woods.

01:06:49.339 --> 01:06:51.170
You didn't say anything to me.

01:06:51.174 --> 01:06:52.634
No, not you.

01:06:54.136 --> 01:06:57.013
I told the fella that struts funny.

01:06:58.140 --> 01:07:01.727
You mean Corporal Ahn?
What'd you tell him?

01:07:02.978 --> 01:07:06.523
There's a monster in the woods.

01:07:07.983 --> 01:07:11.361
Don't worry about it now.
We caught it.

01:07:11.695 --> 01:07:13.613
That's not all.

01:07:14.072 --> 01:07:16.154
What do you mean?

01:07:16.158 --> 01:07:17.530
Hey. Gwang-soon.

01:07:17.534 --> 01:07:18.452
Sung-ae.

01:07:19.202 --> 01:07:20.495
Right, Sung-ae.

01:07:20.996 --> 01:07:22.706
What I'm saying is...

01:07:23.248 --> 01:07:28.170
It's not just one monster
out in them woods.

01:07:29.254 --> 01:07:34.259
There's more of those
foul creatures still out there.

01:07:41.057 --> 01:07:42.726
What a stink.

01:07:44.102 --> 01:07:46.521
