01:07:48.356 --> 01:07:50.776
Some tissue to cover your nose?

01:07:53.195 --> 01:07:54.108
Where is it?

01:07:54.112 --> 01:07:55.071
Over there.

01:07:57.574 --> 01:07:58.867
Great work.

01:08:01.161 --> 01:08:04.080
Ugh, the smell is brutal.
Tissue!

01:08:28.480 --> 01:08:32.526
It doesn't appear as big
as you described.

01:08:35.570 --> 01:08:37.401
Looks about three meters tall.

01:08:37.405 --> 01:08:38.281
Sure.

01:08:39.115 --> 01:08:41.076
Give me a flashlight.

01:08:44.871 --> 01:08:45.872
Follow me.

01:08:49.751 --> 01:08:51.082
There is the hand.

01:08:51.086 --> 01:08:52.583
Fingernails.

01:08:52.587 --> 01:08:53.880
Five fingers.

01:08:54.256 --> 01:08:55.590
Three knuckles.

01:08:56.091 --> 01:08:58.510
The same as a human hand.

01:09:00.887 --> 01:09:03.765
Thigh. Calf.

01:09:04.683 --> 01:09:07.978
There's another joint here.

01:09:10.188 --> 01:09:11.147
It...

01:09:13.441 --> 01:09:15.026
It has four toes.

01:09:18.947 --> 01:09:22.492
