01:10:54.334 --> 01:10:55.794
Get me a bigger one.

01:10:57.712 --> 01:11:00.048
Maybe the skin is too thick.

01:11:15.230 --> 01:11:17.482
Shit, this doesn't work either.

01:11:20.819 --> 01:11:22.028
How strange.

01:11:33.873 --> 01:11:34.916
Goddamn it!

01:11:39.129 --> 01:11:41.047
Fuck, it's not going in!

01:12:07.449 --> 01:12:10.076
Sorry, I need to write this down.

01:12:13.288 --> 01:12:15.244
Okay. Tell me what you saw.

01:12:15.248 --> 01:12:16.916
A few days back,

01:12:17.709 --> 01:12:20.378
me and some buddies went hunting.

01:12:22.547 --> 01:12:25.842
We got out of the truck
and got to walking.

01:12:27.343 --> 01:12:30.180
About twenty minutes in...

01:12:32.098 --> 01:12:33.308
Suddenly...

01:12:34.684 --> 01:12:36.853
I had to shit.

01:12:37.312 --> 01:12:38.313
Pardon?

01:12:39.689 --> 01:12:41.649
I had to take a dump.

01:12:45.945 --> 01:12:47.739
Okay. Then what?

01:12:48.198 --> 01:12:52.994
I made some spicy pork
the night before...

01:12:53.703 --> 01:12:56.998
-It must've been bad.
-I see.

01:12:58.500 --> 01:13:00.956
It put me in a tough spot.

01:13:00.960 --> 01:13:02.754
I couldn't hold it.

01:13:03.505 --> 01:13:07.092
So I told my buddies to
go on ahead.

01:13:07.717 --> 01:13:12.093
I was alone,
ready to do the deed.

01:13:12.097 --> 01:13:16.601
But the slope was real steep.

01:13:18.394 --> 01:13:23.854
Just as I pulled down my pants,

01:13:23.858 --> 01:13:26.357
I lost my footing.

01:13:26.361 --> 01:13:30.323
And I was off,
rolling down the hill.

01:13:31.199 --> 01:13:35.370
Tearing through the bushes
hurt worse than hell.

01:13:36.079 --> 01:13:39.207
But when nature called, she yelled.

01:13:39.999 --> 01:13:43.419
So there I am, popping a squat.

01:13:44.254 --> 01:13:48.424
All of a sudden,
I hear something move.

01:13:48.842 --> 01:13:51.261
Scared shitless, I look around.

01:13:52.554 --> 01:13:53.888
Holy Mother.

01:13:54.764 --> 01:13:57.513
It was them fucking monsters.

01:13:57.517 --> 01:14:01.688
