02:20:28.546 --> 02:20:30.297
How's he so good at shooting?

02:20:31.799 --> 02:20:34.548
What are you, a movie star?

02:20:34.552 --> 02:20:36.595
So damn hot!

02:20:38.472 --> 02:20:42.685
I fucking did it.
I killed a fucking alien!

02:20:44.645 --> 02:20:47.769
You did good too.

02:20:47.773 --> 02:20:52.023
What'd I say?
I told you you'd get fucked.

02:20:52.027 --> 02:20:53.654
Oh my God, I love you!

02:21:01.871 --> 02:21:03.038
What...

02:21:03.706 --> 02:21:05.916
What just happened?

02:21:06.959 --> 02:21:08.623
Hey, why...

02:21:08.627 --> 02:21:10.504
Why did you turn the wheel?

02:21:12.548 --> 02:21:13.795
Huh?

02:21:13.799 --> 02:21:15.176
Did you turn the wheel?

02:21:15.634 --> 02:21:17.303
-I did.
-Why?

02:21:18.053 --> 02:21:20.181
A cat jumped out.

02:21:20.639 --> 02:21:21.932
A cat?

02:21:24.310 --> 02:21:27.521
How... could this happen?

02:21:53.172 --> 02:21:54.423
What's that?

02:21:59.220 --> 02:22:00.387
Dear God.

02:22:00.888 --> 02:22:02.514
What am I seeing right now?

02:22:32.044 --> 02:22:33.754
Ma'veyyo.

02:22:41.053 --> 02:22:42.805
Your Majesty.

02:22:43.806 --> 02:22:45.849
Do you see what I see?

02:22:48.060 --> 02:22:51.105
The Emperor's ship is falling.

02:23:04.952 --> 02:23:07.746
What is upon us?

02:23:26.932 --> 02:23:28.809
This is not real.

02:23:30.019 --> 02:23:32.271
This can't be happening.

02:23:55.669 --> 02:23:56.754
No way...

02:25:06.573 --> 02:25:08.742
We must reach him immediately.

02:25:09.326 --> 02:25:11.286
Are you able to run?

02:25:13.455 --> 02:25:16.333
There is no time, Your Majesty.

02:25:17.292 --> 02:25:19.503
Only three molli remain.

02:25:21.088 --> 02:25:23.799
The Emperor's ship has fallen.

02:25:36.437 --> 02:25:40.983
It is a tragedy but it is done.

02:26:06.341 --> 02:26:09.090
You gotta hang in there.
We can't give up.

02:26:09.094 --> 02:26:11.513
You've got to keep up.

02:26:12.139 --> 02:26:14.095
-Alright.
-We gotta keep running.

02:26:14.099 --> 02:26:15.763
They're still after us.

02:26:15.767 --> 02:26:16.977
I know that!

02:26:43.003 --> 02:26:44.922
Falter not, Your Majesty.

02:26:45.714 --> 02:26:49.259
In the name of Gh'ertu,

02:26:50.093 --> 02:26:52.971
I shall find the Prince.

02:26:58.477 --> 02:27:03.690
I shall change his destiny.

02:27:26.213 --> 02:27:30.259
This heart will revive His Highness.

02:27:32.177 --> 02:27:35.305
Should his destiny change,

02:27:35.931 --> 02:27:39.184
so too shall all of ours.

02:28:01.957 --> 02:28:03.417
What do we do now?

02:28:04.418 --> 02:28:05.669
Keep running.

02:28:06.128 --> 02:28:07.254
Then what?

02:28:10.257 --> 02:28:11.508
I don't know either.

02:28:13.552 --> 02:28:15.095
My head...

02:28:16.763 --> 02:28:18.557
I can't figure out what to do.

02:28:19.391 --> 02:28:23.395
I'll gather everyone at the school
as planned.

02:28:24.605 --> 02:28:27.733
We hand out the weapons
and form a fortress.

02:28:28.567 --> 02:28:30.902
Okay. Go ahead.

02:28:32.571 --> 02:28:37.284
What's wrong?
You don't like my plan?

02:28:39.536 --> 02:28:42.748
No. I just...

02:28:43.415 --> 02:28:47.624
I feel lost... and strange.

02:28:47.628 --> 02:28:51.757
Sung-ki was just out of luck.

02:28:52.883 --> 02:28:55.344
That lunatic at the wheel

02:28:55.719 --> 02:28:58.801
was put there by a twist of fate.

02:28:58.805 --> 02:29:00.307
Officer Yim!

02:29:01.516 --> 02:29:02.351
Yes.

02:29:03.143 --> 02:29:05.937
Quit talking.
I'm out of breath.

02:29:08.649 --> 02:29:10.150
Yes, Chief.

02:29:31.922 --> 02:29:35.467
In a recent dream,
the Emperor came to me.

02:29:37.552 --> 02:29:39.137
Your Majesty.

02:29:42.557 --> 02:29:45.227
He spoke to me.

02:29:45.644 --> 02:29:52.234
He said faith is evidence
of what we do not see.

02:29:56.029 --> 02:30:01.993
What I am seeing now
is not evidence.

02:30:05.163 --> 02:30:08.538
What I long for...

02:30:08.542 --> 02:30:14.214
has not been realized yet.

02:30:18.135 --> 02:30:19.428
Ma'veyyo.

02:30:20.429 --> 02:30:21.930
Your Majesty.

02:30:27.060 --> 02:30:29.354
Bring forth true fate.
